        },
        {
          "text": "U-Abrahama wathatha indodana yakhe u-Ishmayeli nabo bonke ababezelwe endlini yakhe, nabo bonke abathengwa ngemali yakhe, bonke abesilisa phakathi kwabantu bendlu ka-Abrahama; basoka inyama yejwabu ngalolo suku, njengalokho uNkulunkulu emyalile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
